{"id":1256,"bodyHtml":"<div><div><p>为关注高校教师心理健康，助力教师构建幸福家庭，5月13日下午三点，在12号楼二层东厅艺术学院党委和工会为全院教师精心组织了一场主题为“高校教师心理素质建设与幸福家庭经营之道”的专题讲座，特邀心理学专家李梅老师担任主讲嘉宾。</p><p><img src=\"/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=/LmrKfUz98Lz9anOmWRUmlZM874M4VxkU4fkM46VL7-Ynmv0gihFp2hmCIa0LkhRLYy4oShkL7Wknzlbnz-8nRUYozGbUNQVMRNaMzfVnznFUz-ao7-8L4VFU8-ZUNlJv2bjo4OeoDbT6DVY6khXptQ0g4-aLRN0Lzv8Mm9JqdJnx&oid=2004969448&tid=2009&nid=17468&e=.png\" vsbhref=\"vurl\" vurl=\"/_vsl/0C339B0BBE59E24D42909BFE49050EE4/A208B431/CB8BE\" vheight=\"\" vwidth=\"500\" alt=\"\" orisrc=\"/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=/LmrKfUz98Lz9anOmWRUmlZM874M4VxkU4fkM46VL7-Ynmv0gihFp2hmCIa0LkhRLYy4oShkL7Wknzlbnz-8nRUYozGbUNQVMRNaMzfVnznFUz-ao7-8L4VFU8-ZUNlJv2bjo4OeoDbT6DVY6khXptQ0g4-aLRN0Lzv8Mm9JqdJnx&oid=2004969448&tid=2009&nid=17468&e=.png\"></p><p>李梅老师以亲和幽默的语言迅速拉近与在场教师的距离，开启了这场充满智慧与温情的分享之旅。讲座以“一碗米线”的故事，说明了有效沟通的重要性；通过不同版本《龟兔赛跑》的故事，进一步说明多个角度看问题和心理素质建设的重要性；以一个个真实的案例详细解读了孩子心态和行为状态之间的关系，深入浅出地阐述了心理素质建设中环境、方法、状态三个要素的关系，触发老师们思考如何与学生或孩子进行有效沟通。讲座之后，老师们围坐在李老师旁边，纷纷就自己在工作和家庭生活中遇到的困惑向李老师请教，现场讨论氛围热烈。</p><p><img src=\"/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=/nRrK7MNW7LRNiUOzT2Um-PMR-iUlQx2LNV2UzMVnmAfUz70gihFp2hmCIa0MYhfM1y8L1hRUNWRn77sM4M2nmUanRNaLzVRUmUDnlM7LNVFMzfVM49aL4fFnz-8oR9Jv2bjo4OeoDbT6DVY6khXptQ0g4-aLRN0Lzv8Mm9JqdJnx&oid=2004969448&tid=2009&nid=17468&e=.png\" vsbhref=\"vurl\" vurl=\"/_vsl/7A642CBBCDA773FF40D9011CB46ECD2A/50E78030/E2488\" vheight=\"\" vwidth=\"500\" alt=\"\" orisrc=\"/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=/nRrK7MNW7LRNiUOzT2Um-PMR-iUlQx2LNV2UzMVnmAfUz70gihFp2hmCIa0MYhfM1y8L1hRUNWRn77sM4M2nmUanRNaLzVRUmUDnlM7LNVFMzfVM49aL4fFnz-8oR9Jv2bjo4OeoDbT6DVY6khXptQ0g4-aLRN0Lzv8Mm9JqdJnx&oid=2004969448&tid=2009&nid=17468&e=.png\"></p><p>此次专题讲座的成功举办，不仅为艺术学院教师提供了宝贵的心理健康和家庭经营知识，也体现了学院党委和工会对教师身心健康和生活幸福的高度重视。未来，艺术学院党委和工会将继续秉持服务教师的宗旨，组织更多丰富多彩、富有意义的活动，为教师们的工作和生活保驾护航，助力学院教育事业高质量发展。</p><p><img src=\"/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=/L4NKZM8LPMl-8nO7Q7LNlbL4Gsoz6xRLmARnNV7M4UYL770gihFp2hmCIa0oSysUSysnkyanRWVMRT7olQ7M7UaUmvbL8VfUz7PLNrfLzVFn7CYnmf2MzTFM467MRUJv2bjo4OeoDbT6DVY6khXptQ0g4-aLRN0Lzv8Mm9JqdJnx&oid=2004969448&tid=2009&nid=17468&e=.png\" vsbhref=\"vurl\" vurl=\"/_vsl/97A7D0D2E49D9FD4D0B793AAA112EA11/DF2F0F59/77D44\" vheight=\"\" vwidth=\"500\" alt=\"\" orisrc=\"/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=/L4NKZM8LPMl-8nO7Q7LNlbL4Gsoz6xRLmARnNV7M4UYL770gihFp2hmCIa0oSysUSysnkyanRWVMRT7olQ7M7UaUmvbL8VfUz7PLNrfLzVFn7CYnmf2MzTFM467MRUJv2bjo4OeoDbT6DVY6khXptQ0g4-aLRN0Lzv8Mm9JqdJnx&oid=2004969448&tid=2009&nid=17468&e=.png\"></p><p><img src=\"/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=/U87K8MR6RM7nRLON7aMz-aolUYMm6x2UlUsL7LsoRWVnNL0gihFp2hmCIa0USysLkhRMYhkL7lPM7-aMllPoRL4nm9bUm7ZMlrVLmA7LlnFoRUYLzC4nlrFMm9soR9Jv2bjo4OeoDbT6DVY6khXptQ0g4-aLRN0Lzv8Mm9JqdJnx&oid=2004969448&tid=2009&nid=17468&e=.png\" vsbhref=\"vurl\" vurl=\"/_vsl/A70C7B0E14B05E1833F89B185EE28D1D/842163EE/68788\" vheight=\"\" vwidth=\"500\" alt=\"\" orisrc=\"/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=/U87K8MR6RM7nRLON7aMz-aolUYMm6x2UlUsL7LsoRWVnNL0gihFp2hmCIa0USysLkhRMYhkL7lPM7-aMllPoRL4nm9bUm7ZMlrVLmA7LlnFoRUYLzC4nlrFMm9soR9Jv2bjo4OeoDbT6DVY6khXptQ0g4-aLRN0Lzv8Mm9JqdJnx&oid=2004969448&tid=2009&nid=17468&e=.png\"></p><p><img src=\"/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=/U4rK7Mml8U4nVLONQVMmL4LN-soRUxPL8LaU87iMm-aUmv0gihFp2hmCIa0M1hfn1h2M1h2Ll7iMz-DLmN4olUbM4lZnNCDMmUPUl7sU8VFnmLDL4rRMzrFUmlYMmvJv2bjo4OeoDbT6DVY6khXptQ0g4-aLRN0Lzv8Mm9JqdJnx&oid=2004969448&tid=2009&nid=17468&e=.png\" vsbhref=\"vurl\" vurl=\"/_vsl/6AFF6F1A55262939D9758FF6641AA7CA/F3635C55/B5267\" vheight=\"\" vwidth=\"500\" alt=\"\" orisrc=\"/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=/U4rK7Mml8U4nVLONQVMmL4LN-soRUxPL8LaU87iMm-aUmv0gihFp2hmCIa0M1hfn1h2M1h2Ll7iMz-DLmN4olUbM4lZnNCDMmUPUl7sU8VFnmLDL4rRMzrFUmlYMmvJv2bjo4OeoDbT6DVY6khXptQ0g4-aLRN0Lzv8Mm9JqdJnx&oid=2004969448&tid=2009&nid=17468&e=.png\"></p><p><br /></p><p>一审：陆晨曦</p><p>二审：郭云霞</p></div></div>","bodyText":"","attachments":[],"image":"http://art.nuc.edu.cn/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=/LmrKfUz98Lz9anOmWRUmlZM874M4VxkU4fkM46VL7-Ynmv0gihFp2hmCIa0LkhRLYy4oShkL7Wknzlbnz-8nRUYozGbUNQVMRNaMzfVnznFUz-ao7-8L4VFU8-ZUNlJv2b